WEBVTT

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.030
In the end, I was not able to deal 
the final blow to the Cabernet...

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:41.280
It burrowed into the ground and escaped.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:42.740
Into the ground?

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:48.330
The Cabernet is clearly an entirely 
different class of gaichuu than we've encountered.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:53.220
It's possible it will heal its wounds 
while underground and rise up once again.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.530
It'll come back?

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.190
If the Doctor's hypothesis is true,

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.580
we should exterminate it 
somehow before it comes back.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:05.610
But it's deep in the ground... 
Searching for it would be...

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.060
Underground, huh?

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.700
I bet he'd...

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:11.560
He?

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.140
Gus.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.070
Gus?

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:17.190
Yeah. Connor brags about him all the time.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:22.830
He says his nose is so good he picks out 
the smell of pizza from the town next door

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.990
or a bone buried deep in the earth.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:26.950
Then if we had Gus...

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.420
We might be able to find 
out where the thing is.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.720
But we'll need Connor's cooperation for that.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:48.310
Smile of Hope

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.640
Connor...

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:01.070
Good morning. You are 
always up nice and early.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.280
Thank you.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:35.730
Sunny...

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.770
You're heading to Lament to see Connor?

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:47.520
Yeah.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:51.230
I noticed that I hadn't seen 
him lately, so I asked Zazie,

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.680
and he told me was taking a long vacation.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.000
Tell me Lag, did something happen to Connor?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:11.630
Give back Sunny's heart!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.810
Give it back!

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:22.300
Then when I suggested we all go home...

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.470
I need a vacation.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.640
A vacation?

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.830
But why, Connor?

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:32.040
Sorry, but please take 
this to the Master for me.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.840
Connor...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.890
I'm going to stay here and watch after Sunny.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.440
I'm counting on you, Lag.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.380
Connor!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.980
You're not planning to 
quit being a Bee, right?

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.280
You're going to come back, right?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.940
I can't believe something 
like that happened...

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:06.820
The Master accepted his request 
for leave without saying a word,

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.960
but I haven't heard anything 
from Connor since...

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.370
I'm worried, too.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.030
That's why I think this is a good chance.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:22.220
But... I don't know yet if 
Connor will help us or not.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:27.140
Then I'll add to the effort 
with my cooking and make soup.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.770
Lag, deliver it to Connor!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.680
Yes! If he eats my soup, he's 
sure to start to feel better!

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.890
Then he'll help you and everyone out!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.180
Okay! I'm gonna do it!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.270
I'll make it extra-specially delicious!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.270
Actually, I think that might back-fire...

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:45.860
It's time to make some magic!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.150
He'll definitely fire-back.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:56.460
In the end, I just couldn't say no.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:58.520
I can see it, Lag!

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.390
The city of Lament...

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:16.300
Lag, where is Connor?

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:19.100
Not just him... I don't 
see any people at all.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.620
Is anybody here?

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.010
It's Gus!

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.110
Wait, Gus!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.880
Gus!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.760
Gus... Where's Connor?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.560
Flowers?

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.780
This is...

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.680
Connor... Connor!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.030
Connor!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.030
Lag.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.620
Thank you, Gus.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.400
Connor... What are these graves?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.750
For the people who had their 
hearts stolen by the Cabernet.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.750
You seem well, Lag.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.010
You too, Niche.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.970
Um, Connor... The reason I'm here is...

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.550
You came to tell me I've been 
fired from the Bees, right?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.850
I'm prepared for that.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.190
I demanded a vacation, then 
didn't contact anyone...

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.520
I've been staying here the whole time, see.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.580
T-That's not it at all, Connor!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.250
I have a letter from the Master.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.100
A letter?

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:03.220
The Cabernet... That monster is still alive?

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.170
Yeah.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:11.720
I'm sorry, but I can't come with you, Lag.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:20.940
This is...

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.210
You know this place, Lag?

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:27.970
Yes. This was a hidden Reverse base.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.930
Wait up, Connor!

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:36.820
So, Connor...

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:43.950
You said those graves were for people whose 
hearts were stolen by the Cabernet, right?

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:47.580
Yeah. I buried them all.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:51.210
And... Sunny, as well?

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.470
No.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.840
Sunny's alive.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:57.900
Really?

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:58.550
Yeah.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:03.810
Steak... This place is full of yummy smell!

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.670
Yeah... It smells like cookies!

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:11.400
Come.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:25.230
S-Sunny!

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:29.870
I see! The Cabernet didn't 
eat your heart after all!

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:34.130
Thank goodness... Thank goodness, Sunny...

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:41.590
It's me! Do you remember me? I 
was together with Connor, and...

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:46.230
It's no use.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:47.980
No use?

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:52.940
It doesn't matter what you say... 
Sunny can't hear you now.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.260
She... can't hear?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:09.030
I remained in this town to watch over Sunny.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:14.730
This is... the final one...

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.620
Damn you, Reverse...

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.200
Why did you do something so cruel?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:33.730
Sunny... You're okay?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:34.820
Sunny!

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:40.150
I-I see! You just fainted! You didn't 
have your heart eaten after all!

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.480
Thank goodness...

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:46.880
Just knowing that at least 
you were saved makes me...

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.290
Sunny?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.200
What's the matter all of a sudden?

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:02.910
Well, I do want to eat your cookies, 
but right now that's not...

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.280
Hey, Sunny...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.780
Sunny... You're...

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.180
Since then, Sunny continued to bake cookies.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.530
Day after day.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.140
Then, Sunny's heart really was...

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.730
Thank you, Sunny.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:44.520
In the end, all I can do for her 
is to eat the cookies she bakes.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:47.720
But, why cookies?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.640
It's proof that she's alive.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:55.860
The cookies she bakes here 
are proof that Sunny is alive.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.940
Proof she's alive?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:04.950
But, I'm a Bee. I know what happens in 
the end when you lose all your heart.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.590
In the end?

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:11.160
That's why... I at least want to be with her.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.960
Until the last moment.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:21.420
Connor. Actually, I wasn't able 
to shoot a shindan before.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.730
You couldn't? Really?

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:25.500
Really.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:26.930
But...

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:34.260
By believing in my heart, I 
was able to shoot one again.

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:37.790
Believing in one's heart, huh?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:38.450
Yes!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:41.430
Believe in Sunny's heart!

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:46.450
Because she's still baking cookies, 
even though she knows nothing else!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:54.350
That's why you can't give up, Connor!

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.040
I did my best, thinking like that.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:02.600
I've been talking to her the whole 
time, even taking her outside.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.460
But Sunny's expression didn't change at all.

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:09.760
All she can do is bake cookies in this place!

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:13.190
She doesn't have any heart left.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:19.760
The cookie baking is nothing more than 
habit from before she lost her heart!

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:23.880
How can you be sure of that?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.640
Connor...

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.020
Let's take Sunny to the Bee Hive.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.410
To the Bee Hive?

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:39.060
Yeah. We'll get Doctor 
Thunderland to examine her.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.460
To examine her?

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:46.770
Yeah... If we do that, then... 
Then she might get better!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:51.030
And if she doesn't?

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:57.320
It's better than being in a place like this.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:00.810
Sunny lived her life to bake cookies.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.550
Even after she lost her heart...

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:06.490
I can't bring myself to 
take her away from here.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.950
But, Connor...

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.200
Please, stop this!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:16.000
I'm begging you... Go away.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:24.030
I understand, Connor...

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.960
Let's go, Niche.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:37.180
Connor... I'm sorry for all 
the selfish things I said.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:39.910
And I'm sorry, too.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:45.370
You've taught me all about Letter 
Bees ever since I lived in Cambel...

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:51.700
If you hadn't been there, I wouldn't 
be here together with Niche right now.

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:55.160
So if you ever have any troubles...

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:59.870
I'll... come straight away... okay?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.620
Wait, Lag!

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:10.390
You need Gus to search 
for the Cabernet, right?

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:13.620
Take Gus in my stead.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.330
Okay, Gus?

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.590
Listen to what Lag says.

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:23.310
You sure, Connor?

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.190
Yeah.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.250
Now, get going, Gus.

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:32.390
Lag, take good care of him.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.210
Uh... sure.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.320
Connor!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:38.520
Gus is your dingo, right?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.810
Why can't he be with Connor?

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:45.620
Niche... It's because he can't.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.710
A dingo and master are always 
together! That's a dingo!

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:51.180
Niche is Lag's dingo!

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:53.930
So Lag and Niche will always be together!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.260
Niche...

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.060
Gus is sad.

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.020
Gus...

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.420
Sunny... But, why?

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:25.570
What is it?

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.940
You're giving them to me?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.720
Yum!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.100
These are really great, Lag!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.120
You try some too, Lag!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.880
Gus, Connor, try some!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.850
Yum! They really are delicious!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.070
Sunny!

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.700
She smiled...

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:07.590
Sunny, why? Up until now, you'd never...

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:17.180
I love it when people look 
happy after eating them, yes!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.220
I see. So that's what it was...

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.680
What do you mean?

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.690
I'm such a fool.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:31.080
Seeing Sunny like this was so tough...

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:38.260
I didn't eat Sunny's cookies with the 
happiness they deserve even once!

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:39.930
Connor...

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.410
They're very delicious, Sunny.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:53.340
I'm sorry... If I had noticed 
your heart sooner, I'd...

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:56.810
Then...

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:00.840
Sunny still has some heart!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.600
It's still there!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:05.580
Still there?

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.110
Her heart?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:11.400
Thank goodness! Thank goodness, Sunny!

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:14.900
Isn't it wonderful, Connor?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.200
Lag...

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:21.670
I'll go back to the Bee Hive too.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:29.090
If Sunny still has a bit of heart 
left, I can't stand by and do nothing.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:35.130
I believe that I can bring 
Sunny's heart back! I do!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.760
Sorry for being like that, Gus.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:45.680
Okay! Then, if it's decided, 
let's get ready to head out!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.640
Yeah!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.150
Sunny's heart still remains.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:04.380
So Gauche's heart... One day... For sure...

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:08.460
U-Uh, Connor...

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:11.420
Actually, Sylvette made you some...

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:15.830
Is that the pukey soup?

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.850
I couldn't turn her down!

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.960
So eat it, please!

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.040
Why me?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.930
Please, Connor!

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:46.700
Next: Lawrence's Ambition
